# Grouped workspace checkouts: nested clones (NOT git submodules).
# Each plugins/<name>/ (e.g. wheel) is an independent full clone with its own
# git history; there is intentionally no `[submodule "plugins/..."]` section
# for them in .gitmodules. Keep this ignore line so the parent index never
# absorbs the nested checkouts; remotes stay authoritative.
plugins/
